  regionName: Whispering Fissure
  showNameOnEnter: 1
  devCape: 1
  devAbilities: 11
  devFlags: []
  notes: "A crack up through the strata where the Shapeshifter's whisper leaks out.
    Climb from the bottom to the top.\nExits: west opening \u2192 back to the crack
    in the Slums; east opening at the bottom \u2192 Hall of Measure;\neast opening
    at the top, behind the Rank Gate (Mould gate) \u2192 Prism Caverns: optional,
    come back with the Mould.\nLate game: the corrupted Old Triangle appears here
    (not built)."
